    [239565]={status="ok",name="Garb of Revelation",quality=4,tip="Sanctified\nItem Level 98\nBinds when picked upChestCloth\n146 Armor\n+15 Stamina\n+17 Intellect\nDurability 100 / 100Classes: Priest\n\nRequires Level 60\nEquip: Increases your critical strike by 28.\nEquip: Increases damage done by Shadow spells and effects by up to 76.\n\nEquip: Increases the damage dealt by your damage over time spells by 2%.\n\nRaiments of Revelation (0/8)Crown of Revelation\nMantle of Revelation\nGirdle of Revelation\nPants of Revelation\nBoots of Revelation\nWrists of Revelation\nHands of Revelation\nGarb of Revelation\n\n(2) Set : Your Mind Flay and Mind Sear no longer lose duration from taking damage during their channel. In addition, they deal 10% increased damage per other periodic Shadow effect you have on the target, up to a maximum increase of 30%.\n(4) Set : Your Mind Blast deals 100% reduced threat, and gains 20% damage increase from each stack of Mind Spike on the target.\n(6) Set : Damage done by your Mind Flay now increases the longer you channel the spell. Each time it deals damage, subsequent damage will increase by 285000%. This resets on each new channel.\nSell Price: 13 2 90"},
